DESCRIPTION:Questions That Matter (Free Weekly Wed 6pm Meetup Group) For most of human history identities were strictly ascribed to us by family\, lineage\, or geography. Today (especially in transient hubs like Chiang Mai) we seemingly have the unprecedented freedom to curate our own avatars. Yet\, like all supposed newfound freedoms this also can introduce modern anxieties. And to soothe those anxieties\, we of
